Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: spi: apple: Add the T8132 SPI controller

The M4's SPI controllers are the T8103 design, as on T8140.

Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
(cherry picked from commit a1088a99ddde01fbe50891ad456643521a6b7eed)
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
index 4b30265686..8553561aaa 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - apple,t6020-spi
+              - apple,t8132-spi
               - apple,t8140-spi
           - const: apple,t8103-spi
       - items:
